{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：12:45 2026-10-18 HKT<br/>發佈時間：12:45 2026-10-18 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：12:45 2026-10-18 HKT</p><img alt=\"fb南區街坊之友圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fe1858c312fca831358fe886f891d19c/2026-10/page_150.jpg\"/><p>今日（18日）11時03分，港島南區香港仔中心地下的一間百佳超級市場發生火警，冒出濃煙。現場是南寧街13至23號，據報是超市的廚房爐頭失火。消防員接報到場，但發現火勢已熄滅，只殘留部分濃煙。事件中沒有人受傷，亦毋須疏散，火警原因有待調查。</p><img alt=\"fb南區街坊之友圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cc9b1be3faabd24add8b6ee979395cca/2026-10/1_4_76.jpg\" title=\"fb南區街坊之友圖片\"/><p>fb南區街坊之友圖片</p><img alt=\"fb南區街坊之友圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e0e289a37fe90556a5ed73913453e44b/2026-10/2_2_72.jpg\" title=\"fb南區街坊之友圖片\"/><p>fb南區街坊之友圖片</p><img alt=\"fb南區街坊之友圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f467c240e80a08a7a6e574ab11f8350b/2026-10/3_24_65.jpg\" title=\"fb南區街坊之友圖片\"/><p>fb南區街坊之友圖片</p><img alt=\"fb南區街坊之友圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/06790310de2afd52127120709f79dac7/2026-10/851743856_3711613762324784_4939339737753672060_n.jpg\" title=\"fb南區街坊之友圖片\"/><p>fb南區街坊之友圖片</p><p></p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T05:18:55.818333+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":246,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T04:45:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T07:17:40.433556+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T05:17:48.291158+00:00","content_hash":"094182fe7bb167f40db0f9cbdea951c8c467196a1f625ecef9069c1a6494140f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}